Subject: [PATCH] feat(claims): T10 core - kw-v1 grammar, 0060 claims schema,
 internal/claims

Implements the frozen contract contracts/live-keyword-claims-v1.md (with the
0.1 integrator rulings) for MOCK/manual ingress only:

- migrations/0060_live_claims.sql: live.offers, live.claim_windows and schema
  claims (bundles, lines, events, links), ENABLE+FORCE RLS, exact column
  grants, NOLOGIN commerce_claims_writer owning four SECURITY DEFINER
  functions (preview_link, redeem_link, mark_applied, issue_link) with
  search_path pinned, and COMMENT ON for every table/function.
- internal/claims/grammar: pure kw-v1 Parse/NormalizeKeyword/NormalizeLabel
  with redacted Result; tests/claims/kw-v1-vectors.json holds every 2.4
  example; TestGrammarKC01Vectors + FuzzParse (KC01).
- internal/claims: GetBoard, SetWindow, CreateOffer, UpdateOffer,
  RecordManualClaim, ListBundles, IssueLink, Ingest/IngestParsed,
  PreviewLink, RedeemLink with the frozen signatures and 4.5 error mapping.
- storefront.LockCartOwner (SetCart now calls it; same advisory key) and
  pagination collection claim-bundles.

P2 closures: (a) writer UPDATE policies repeat BUYER/MERCHANT in WITH CHECK
so OR-ed permissive policies cannot mix contexts; (b) labels validated in Go
and a targetless ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING avoids 23505 DETAIL echo; (c)
claims.events.bundle_version makes duplicate ingest fully reconstructible;
(d) NormalizeLabel strips @ before the final trim and is idempotent; (e)
mode changes only while CLOSED; (f) unavailable pending lines are skipped
and stay pending; (g) 72 h TTL enforced by CHECK and the definer.

Evidence: unit tests + 60 s fuzz; REAL_PG smoke TestLiveClaimsCoreSmoke.
KC02-KC15 gates are NOT_RUN (independent test_worker).

